        "@value": "After your triumphant and delicious Gourmet Ski adventures, join us at the Sunset Theatre for the annual cavalcade of carefully curated films celebrating everything ski-jacent.  For more information about the Gourmet Ski, visit  wellstrails.ca    Buy Your Film Festival Tickets Here!  or at the Door."
