      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Come to the Sunset Theatre in Wells for our first Emerging Artist Weekend!&nbsp;  Sunday August 17th at 8pm join us for an enthralling evening of music performed by Lucy Jeffery, Philippa Ryder, Connor Ritchie and Caleb Oman."
      }
    ],
