      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Come to the Sunset Theatre in Wells for our first Emerging Artist Weekend!&nbsp;    On Saturday August 16th at 8pm we’re thrilled to host two brand-new theatre shows:  Luch’s Legacy,  created and performed by Lucy Jeffery, and    I can’t believe you turned my barbie house into a whiskey bar , cr"
