      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Molly Wilson brings to the Sunset a high-energy, heartfelt musical comedy cabaret in a vibrant celebration of Canada’s most iconic female singers.  From  Anne Murray to Alanis Morissette, Carly Rae Jepsen to Celine Dion, and K.D. Lang to Joni Mitchell ,   Molly Wilson  delivers a tour de force perfo"
      }
