      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Come experience Julia Mackey’s Governor General award-winning play about a WWII veteran’s reluctant return to Normandy to find the grave of the brother who never came home.  https://jakesgift.com  FESTIVAL AND DAY PASS TICKETS AVAILABLE VIA  ARTSWELLS"
