        "@value": "CANCELLED DUE TO THE WELLS WILDFIRE EVACUATION ORDER    UPDATE July 26th - We are now back to an Evacuation Alert but because most of Cabaret Performers are only getting back to Wells this coming weekend, we will not have time to put Cabaret together for tomorrow, July 27th. We will host a few more"
