        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "THE TEST - FIRESMART DOCUMENTARY  Come enjoy an evening at the Sunset Theatre to view The Test, a documentary about wildfire resilience! There will be some light appetizers and non alcoholic beverages provided!   Details   June 18, 2024, doors open at 6:30, film starts at 7:00  Sunset Theatre  Cost:"
