      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Like only a family band can, their harmonies are pure and true. Come see them deliver a range of music from mash-up rockers, to slow and ponderous classic folk. These folk have it all.   “Far and away the revelation of this session was the Janzen Boys, a family trio from Winnipeg. Their songs were s"
