      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Hello!  We’ll be taking a break from Programming from Oct 20th to November 30th.   We will see you in December for some Holiday Films and Concerts and our Christmas Cabaret!  Stay Tuned!  #SeeYouAtTheSunset    Photo Credit:  Danette Boucher"
