        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "After three years, Juno Productions are getting back to touring their award winning play, Jake’s Gift.   They’ve been rehearsing at the Sunset and would love an audience to share Jake's story with before hitting the road.   If you can make it, please join us at the Sunset Theatre on Tuesday, Septemb"
