    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "We are starting  occasional Throwback Thursday movie nights as of Aug 11th! With the sad news this week of Olivia Newton John passing away (RIP Sandy) we are dusting off the download of GREASE from 1978 and toasting the Pink Lady!  Grab a burger at the Osisko Community BBQ (5PM to 8PM at The Wells C"
