        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Sunset Speakeasy   Ten shows. One long weekend.  Our inaugural Sunset Speakeasy Festival is bristling with brand-new works from renowned theatre artists, veteran musicians, and emerging artists. Four of these new works were developed right here at the Sunset Theatre through our Exploration Series."
