        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Come out for an evening of music and fine fellowship with immaculate tunesmith Bob Campbell.    With special guest Donovan Weaver   And along with Other Suprise Guests, maybe, perhaps never – also from what I’ve heard – no, probably, but seriously – you never know.  Fer Pete’s sake, it’s Bob’s birth"
