        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The Wells Community Forest is hosting a FireSmart meeting to inform residents about how to FireSmart your home and our community.   The presentation starts at 7PM on Monday, July 5, 2021.   Please contact the Sunset to reserve your spot as only 50 seats are available.   Sunsettheatre @gmail.com or c"
