      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Join us on Thurdsay, October 29 @ The Sunset for this one act reading of Sir Arthur Conan Doyle's, The Lion's Mane, narrated by local actor &amp; musician, JP Winslow, who himself played Sherlock Holmes in the award winning film, The Doctor's Case, directed by James Douglas.  Doors open at 7:30P"
      }
