        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Tickets:   $10 Running Time:   1 hour &amp; 41 minutes Rating:   PG 13 (Thematic Elements|Some Violent Images) Genre:   Adventure, Animation, Comedy  Join us for another beautiful creation by director, Wes Anderson.&nbsp;  When, by executive decree, all the canine pets of Megasaki City"
