        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Tickets:   $5.00 Running Time:   1 hour 45 minutes  Synopsis:   Beautiful but pious sisters Martine (Birgitte Federspiel) and Philippa (Bodil Kjer) grow to spinsterhood under the wrathful eye of their strict pastor father on the forbidding and desolate coast of Jutland, until one day, Philippa's for"
