      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "We are thrilled to be re-mounting our much beloved Moonrise Film Festival, which ran annually on the last weekend of August from 2013 to 2018.   Last year, the Festival took a break as our fantastic producer and curator, Daniel Jeffery, had bigger plans and got Married! Happy 1st Anniversary, Daniel"
