      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "The third film from pop-music-obsessed director Baz Luhrmann tweaks the conventions of the musical genre by mixing a period romance with anachronistic dialogue and songs in the style of his previous Romeo+Juliet (1996).   Ewan McGregor stars as Christian, who leaves behind his bourgeois father durin"
